{
  "name": "PeduliBersama - Telegram Bot Integration Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message",
          "callback_query"
        ],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "node-telegram-trigger",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "pedulibersama-telegram-webhook",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Menerima pesan teks & klik tombol dari Telegram"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normalisasi input dari Telegram (pesan teks atau tombol callback)\nconst item = $input.item.json;\nlet text = '';\nlet chatId = '';\nlet fromName = '';\nlet callbackQueryId = null;\n\nif (item.callback_query) {\n  text = item.callback_query.data || '';\n  chatId = item.callback_query.message.chat.id;\n  fromName = item.callback_query.from.first_name || 'Sahabat';\n  callbackQueryId = item.callback_query.id;\n} else if (item.message) {\n  text = (item.message.text || '').trim();\n  chatId = item.message.chat.id;\n  fromName = item.message.from.first_name || 'Sahabat';\n}\n\nlet command = 'unknown';\nlet query = '';\n\nif (text === '/start' || text.toLowerCase() === 'halo' || text.toLowerCase() === 'hai') {\n  command = 'start';\n} else if (text === '/program' || text === 'cmd_program' || text.toLowerCase().includes('program') || text.toLowerCase().includes('donasi')) {\n  command = 'program';\n} else if (text.startsWith('/detail') || text.startsWith('cmd_detail_')) {\n  command = 'detail';\n  query = text.replace('cmd_detail_', '').replace('/detail', '').trim();\n} else if (text.startsWith('/cari') || text.startsWith('cmd_cari_')) {\n  command = 'search';\n  query = text.replace('cmd_cari_', '').replace('/cari', '').trim();\n} else if (text === '/bantuan' || text === 'cmd_bantuan') {\n  command = 'help';\n}\n\nreturn {\n  chatId,\n  fromName,\n  rawText: text,\n  command,\n  query,\n  callbackQueryId\n};"
      },
      "id": "node-parse-input",
      "name": "Parse Perintah User",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        420,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "string",
        "value1": "={{ $json.command }}",
        "rules": {
          "rules": [
            {
              "value2": "start",
              "outputKey": "start"
            },
            {
              "value2": "program",
              "outputKey": "program"
            },
            {
              "value2": "detail",
              "outputKey": "detail"
            },
            {
              "value2": "search",
              "outputKey": "search"
            },
            {
              "value2": "help",
              "outputKey": "help"
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": "unknown"
      },
      "id": "node-switch-command",
      "name": "Router Perintah",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        640,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Parse Perintah User').item.json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=👋 *Halo, {{ $('Parse Perintah User').item.json.fromName }}!*\n\nSelamat datang di Bot Resmi *PeduliBersama* — Platform Donasi & Penggalangan Dana Terbuka.\n\nMelalui bot ini, Anda dapat melihat program donasi aktif, memantau capaian dana secara real-time, dan berdonasi langsung ke website resmi kami.\n\nSilakan pilih menu di bawah ini untuk memulai:",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_markup": {
            "inline_keyboard": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "📋 Daftar Program Donasi",
                  "callback_data": "cmd_program"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "text": "🌐 Kunjungi Website Resmi",
                  "url": "https://donasi-platform.vercel.app"
                },
                {
                  "text": "❓ Bantuan",
                  "callback_data": "cmd_bantuan"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "node-send-start",
      "name": "Kirim Menu Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://donasi-platform.vercel.app/bot_api.php?action=list",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-http-list",
      "name": "Ambil Data Program (HTTP)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        250
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Parse Perintah User').item.json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.telegram_message }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_markup": {
            "inline_keyboard": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "🌐 Buka Semua di Website",
                  "url": "https://donasi-platform.vercel.app/kampanye.php"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "node-send-program",
      "name": "Kirim Daftar Program",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1160,
        250
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://donasi-platform.vercel.app/bot_api.php?action=detail&id={{ $('Parse Perintah User').item.json.query }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-http-detail",
      "name": "Ambil Detail Program (HTTP)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Parse Perintah User').item.json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.telegram_message }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_markup": {
            "inline_keyboard": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "❤️ Donasi Sekarang di Web",
                  "url": "={{ $json.data.url_detail }}"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "text": "⬅️ Kembali ke Daftar Program",
                  "callback_data": "cmd_program"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "node-send-detail",
      "name": "Kirim Detail Program",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1160,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Parse Perintah User').item.json.chatId }}",
        "text": "=❓ *Pesan Tidak Dikenali*\n\nMaaf, kami belum memahami pesan Anda: \"_{{ $('Parse Perintah User').item.json.rawText }}_\"\n\nSilakan pilih opsi berikut untuk mendapatkan informasi donasi yang sesuai:",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown",
          "reply_markup": {
            "inline_keyboard": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "📋 Lihat Program Donasi",
                  "callback_data": "cmd_program"
                }
              ],
              [
                {
                  "text": "🌐 Kunjungi Portal Website",
                  "url": "https://donasi-platform.vercel.app"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "node-send-fallback",
      "name": "Kirim Balasan Default (Fallback)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        550
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
